{"seq":1,"slug":"search-space-design","title":"搜索空间设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/search-space-design","wordCount":1481,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"搜索空间设计\">搜索空间设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>尺度选择</strong>：对数尺度参数必须用对数采样，否则优化器无法有效覆盖关键低值区域</li>\n<li><strong>条件与层次结构</strong>：树结构空间编码参数依赖关系，TPE 的 define-by-run 天然支持</li>\n<li><strong>空间缩减</strong>：通过 ARD 长度尺度和 fANOVA 重要性分析识别并消除不重要维度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"搜索空间定义了优化的天花板\">搜索空间定义了优化的天花板</h2><p>无论采集函数多聪明、代理模型多精确，贝叶斯优化只能在你定义的搜索空间内寻找最优。空间太窄会错过真正的最优区域；空间太宽则需要更多评估来覆盖，稀释了有效信息密度。搜索空间设计是超参数优化中回报率最高的人工决策——它将领域知识编码为优化器可利用的结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参数类型与尺度变换\">参数类型与尺度变换</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>建议编码</th>\n<th>数学理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连续-线性</td>\n<td>dropout rate <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 0.5]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>等距变化等效用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续-对数</td>\n<td>learning rate <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[10^{-5}, 10^{-1}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对数尺度</td>\n<td>量级变化比绝对变化更有意义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整数-线性</td>\n<td>batch size <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>16</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>32</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>64</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>512</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{16, 32, 64, ..., 512\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">512</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>整数或对数整数</td>\n<td>通常 2 的幂次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类别</td>\n<td>optimizer <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span></span></span></span></span>Adam, SGD, AdamW<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>one-hot / 类别核</td>\n<td>无序关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件</td>\n<td>SGD 的 momentum（仅 optimizer=SGD 时存在）</td>\n<td>树结构</td>\n<td>参数依赖关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有序类别</td>\n<td>layers <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span></span></span></span></span>2, 4, 8, 16<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>整数或有序编码</td>\n<td>有序但非等距</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>对数尺度的重要性</strong>：学习率从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的效果远大于从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.09</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.09</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.09</span></span></span></span></span> 变到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>。如果在线性空间采样，优化器会把绝大部分预算花在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0.01, 0.1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 这个区间，几乎不探索 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[10^{-5}, 10^{-3}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 这个关键低值区域。</p>\n<p>Optuna 的 <code>suggest_float(log=True)</code> 和 Ax 的 <code>log_scale=True</code> 自动处理对数变换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条件与层次搜索空间\">条件与层次搜索空间</h2><p>现代深度学习管线包含大量条件依赖。例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只有选择 ResNet 架构时才有 <code>num_residual_blocks</code> 参数</li>\n<li>只有启用 learning rate warmup 时才有 <code>warmup_steps</code> 参数</li>\n<li>Transformer 的 <code>num_heads</code> 必须能整除 <code>hidden_dim</code></li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[架构类型] --&gt;|ResNet| B[num_blocks&lt;br/&gt;width_multiplier]&#10;    A --&gt;|Transformer| C[num_layers&lt;br/&gt;num_heads&lt;br/&gt;hidden_dim]&#10;    A --&gt;|MLP| D[depth&lt;br/&gt;hidden_size]&#10;    B --&gt; E[共用参数&lt;br/&gt;lr, batch_size, wd]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    C --&gt; F{hidden_dim % num_heads == 0}&#10;    F --&gt;|约束| C\">graph TD\n    A[架构类型] --&gt;|ResNet| B[num_blocks&lt;br/&gt;width_multiplier]\n    A --&gt;|Transformer| C[num_layers&lt;br/&gt;num_heads&lt;br/&gt;hidden_dim]\n    A --&gt;|MLP| D[depth&lt;br/&gt;hidden_size]\n    B --&gt; E[共用参数&lt;br/&gt;lr, batch_size, wd]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    C --&gt; F{hidden_dim % num_heads == 0}\n    F --&gt;|约束| C</pre><p><strong>TPE 的天然优势</strong>：Optuna 的 define-by-run API 允许在目标函数内部用 Python 条件逻辑定义搜索空间——未激活的参数自动被忽略，无需特殊处理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def objective(trial):&#10;    arch = trial.suggest_categorical(&quot;arch&quot;, [&quot;resnet&quot;, &quot;transformer&quot;, &quot;mlp&quot;])&#10;    if arch == &quot;resnet&quot;:&#10;        blocks = trial.suggest_int(&quot;blocks&quot;, 2, 8)&#10;        width = trial.suggest_float(&quot;width_mult&quot;, 0.5, 2.0)&#10;    elif arch == &quot;transformer&quot;:&#10;        layers = trial.suggest_int(&quot;layers&quot;, 2, 12)&#10;        heads = trial.suggest_categorical(&quot;heads&quot;, [4, 8, 16])&#10;        dim = trial.suggest_int(&quot;dim&quot;, 128, 1024, step=heads)&#10;    # ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> objective</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trial):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    arch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_categorical(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"arch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"resnet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transformer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mlp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"resnet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        blocks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_int(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"blocks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_float(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"width_mult\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"transformer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_int(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        heads </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_categorical(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"heads\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_int(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">heads)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>GP 处理条件空间的策略</strong>：Ax/BoTorch 通过 <code>HierarchicalSearchSpace</code> 支持条件参数——内部为每个激活子空间维护独立的 GP，或使用覆盖核（overlap kernel）在不同子空间间共享信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空间缩减策略\">空间缩减策略</h2><p>随着评估积累，优化器对搜索空间的理解加深，可以逐步缩小关注范围。</p>\n<p><strong>边界收缩</strong>：观察到最优配置集中在某个子区域后，手动或自动缩小范围。Ax 的 <code>generation_strategy</code> 支持多阶段策略——先广后窄。</p>\n<p><strong>维度消除</strong>：通过 GP 的 ARD 长度尺度识别不重要参数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 极大的维度），在后续优化中固定这些参数为当前最优值。Optuna 的 <code>fANOVA</code> 重要性分析和 Ax 的 <code>Sensitivity Analysis</code> 提供量化的维度重要性排序。</p>\n<p><strong>自适应空间扩展</strong>：如果最优配置持续撞到空间边界（如学习率总是取到上界），这是空间设计错误的信号——应该扩大该维度的范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见超参数的经验空间\">常见超参数的经验空间</h2><p>基于大规模 HPO 基准研究（如 HPOBench, LCBench）的经验范围：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超参数</th>\n<th>推荐范围</th>\n<th>尺度</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[10^{-5}, 10^{-1}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对数</td>\n<td>Adam 偏低，SGD 偏高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重衰减</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[10^{-6}, 10^{-2}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对数</td>\n<td>数据少时重要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Batch size</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>32</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>64</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>128</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>256</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>512</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{32, 64, 128, 256, 512\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">512</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对数-离散</td>\n<td>影响泛化和速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dropout</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 0.5]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>过拟合严重时提高上界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hidden dim</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>64</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2048</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[64, 2048]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2048</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对数</td>\n<td>2 的幂次通常 GPU 更高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transformer layers</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>24</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[2, 24]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>任务复杂度决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Warmup ratio</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 0.2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>LLM 微调中常 0.03-0.1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些范围不是绝对的——具体任务的合理范围取决于模型规模、数据量和硬件约束。但它们提供了合理的起点，避免空间过宽或过窄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束编码\">约束编码</h2><p>超参数间的数学约束需要编码进搜索空间：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>整除约束</strong>：<code>hidden_dim</code> 必须被 <code>num_heads</code> 整除——用 <code>step</code> 参数或后处理取整</li>\n<li><strong>预算约束</strong>：<code>layers × hidden_dim</code> 不超过参数上限——Ax 的 <code>parameter_constraints</code> 原生支持线性约束</li>\n<li><strong>组合约束</strong>：某些参数组合无效——在目标函数中返回 <code>float(&#39;inf&#39;)</code> 或使用 Optuna 的 <code>trial.report</code> + pruner 机制</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"空间设计的反模式\">空间设计的反模式</h2><p><strong>过度参数化</strong>：同时搜索学习率、学习率调度器类型、调度器参数、warmup 步数、warmup 类型——参数间高度耦合，搜索空间维度爆炸。应该先固定一个调度策略，优化其参数，再在确认它不是瓶颈后考虑是否搜索调度类型。</p>\n<p><strong>忽略相关性</strong>：把 batch_size 和 learning_rate 作为独立参数搜索，但忽略了经典的线性缩放规律（learning rate ∝ batch size）。更好的做法是搜索 <code>base_lr</code> 和 <code>lr_scale_factor</code>，或直接搜索 <code>lr_per_sample = lr / batch_size</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>范围过宽</strong>：学习率搜索范围设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[10^{-10}, 10^{1}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>——绝大部分区域是无效的，浪费了代理模型的建模能力。</p>\n<p>正确的空间设计需要迭代：先用宽范围少量试验确定&quot;有效区域&quot;，然后<a href=\"../hyperparameter/early-stopping-scheduling\">缩小空间</a>集中搜索。这也是为什么实践中贝叶斯优化通常分阶段进行——粗搜 → 精搜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>搜索空间设计是超参数优化中杠杆率最高的人工决策。对数尺度处理跨量级参数、条件结构编码参数依赖、约束编码限制无效组合——这些设计选择直接决定了优化器的效率上限。空间不是一次性设定的——通过维度重要性分析和边界收缩进行迭代精化是成熟的实践模式。避免过度参数化、忽略相关性和范围过宽这三大反模式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"搜索空间设计","id":"搜索空间设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"搜索空间定义了优化的天花板","id":"搜索空间定义了优化的天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"参数类型与尺度变换","id":"参数类型与尺度变换"},{"level":2,"text":"条件与层次搜索空间","id":"条件与层次搜索空间"},{"level":2,"text":"空间缩减策略","id":"空间缩减策略"},{"level":2,"text":"常见超参数的经验空间","id":"常见超参数的经验空间"},{"level":2,"text":"约束编码","id":"约束编码"},{"level":2,"text":"空间设计的反模式","id":"空间设计的反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多保真度方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/multi-fidelity-methods"},"next":{"title":"早停与调度策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/early-stopping-scheduling"}}